  "developer_handoff": [
    "WooPayments provider details should not trigger Jetpack registration/authorization URL generation during unrelated admin renders. Cache or defer WooPaymentsService::get_onboarding_details / get_wpcom_connection_authorization until the explicit onboarding action.",
    "PayPal settings asset localization should not make a blocking partner merchant integration status request on every settings render. Cache ReferenceTransactionStatus or move it behind the refresh_feature_status endpoint already exposed to the page.",
    "Gateway bootstrap repeatedly instantiates DataSynchronizer and reads woocommerce_custom_orders_table_background_sync_mode; cache this option/value within the request or avoid repeated container construction.",
    "WooPayments multicurrency price filters are very hot on large variable product pages: about 40k calls each to selected/stored currency and price conversion helpers in the measured 800-variation page. Add request-level memoization or a batch conversion path.",
    "The heavy order edit page remains dominated by core order-item meta N+1, now addressed by PR #28; gateway activation adds remote WooPayments onboarding calls on top and should be gated away from order-edit pages."
  ]
